WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
One verification line connects systems without implying deployment

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
An indigo ion route climbs a restrained barrier into a practical cell

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Sparse airflow passes through the contactor; a portion reaches a test cartridge

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Reactor zones assemble; indigo marks only measured interfaces

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The module remains partly inside the test bay — no completed transformation

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Only the next experiment enters an active bay; the rest stays lightly drawn
